OL,3,GNEWSA'My dad's Santa protest in the
OL,4,A1970s to get Oxford Street
OL,5,Apedestrianised'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe first person Helen thought of when
OL,8,Fshe learned Oxford Street would be
OL,9,Fpedestrianised was her father.
OL,11,FMore than 50 years before London's most
OL,12,Ffamous shopping destination became
OL,13,Fcar-free, he was being bundled into the
OL,14,Fback of a police van there while
OL,15,Fdressed as Father Christmas.
OL,17,F"Whenever anybody talks about Oxford
OL,18,FStreet, I always think of him," Helen
OL,19,Fsays.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
