OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'My dad's Santa protest in the
OL,4,A1970s to get Oxford Street
OL,5,Apedestrianised'
OL,6,
OL,7,FJohn Davey isn't here to see the
OL,8,Ftransformation of London's most famous
OL,9,Fshopping street. But for his family,
OL,10,Fthe news has brought back memories of a
OL,11,Fprotest that none of them can forget.
